node_modules
.git
.gitignore
*.md
!client/models/README.md
# three.js is served to the browser straight out of node_modules, so a running
# container redistributes it and its MIT notice has to travel along. Excluding
# it here does not just drop the file, it breaks the build - the Dockerfile
# copies it by name.
!NOTICE.md
# And what the software does with what it knows, which is a claim a deployment
# should be able to point at rather than one that lives only in a repository.
!PRIVACY.md
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
client/models/*.glb
client/models/*.gltf
data
